L: List Source Program

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 1

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E49H3

   1 a 0000 E49H3:
   2 a 0006   procedure options(main);
   3 a 0006   /* [E2E-49/P4] BARE/BARE in a SWAPPED weak relation: `na <= nb'
   4 a 0006      (3/3).  Twin: swap loads nb first, collapse 06 03 / 78, weak
   5 a 0006      JC da -- the bare twin of the E49F3 shape modulo names. All
   6 a 0006      three spellings accepted => the relation encoder ignores
   7 a 0006      qualification entirely, exactly as [C344] found for =/^=. */
   8 c 0006   dcl
   9 c 0006     1 rec,
  10 c 0006       2 na char(3),
  11 c 0006       2 nb char(3),
  12 c 0006       2 s2 char(2);
  13 c 0006   dcl k fixed bin(15);
  14 c 0006   if na <= nb then k = 1;
  15 c 001D   put list('K=', k);
  16 c 003F   stop;
  17 a 0042 end E49H3;

CODE SIZE = 0042
DATA AREA = 000C
FREE SYMS = 3888
END  COMPILATION
